  "description": "Fuaran server-driven backend 2 — one bidirectional WebSocket channel over ASP.NET. The lower-latency transport for measured high-frequency interaction (per-keystroke, drag, live cursors). A first-class second backend whose structural identity to the SSE backend (differing only in channel + endpoint glue) is the architectural-integrity check that IFuaranLiveChannel is genuinely transport-neutral. No platform-SDK dependency. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
